---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageKey: countries
title: "Country benchmark — Citere"
description: "The same documented false claims about Ukraine, asked in the local language, across the markets Russia targets. Repeat-rate per assistant and per market."
pagination:
  data: build.languages
  alias: lang
  size: 1
permalink: "{{ '/countries/' | loc(lang) }}"
---
{%- from "partials/bot-mark.njk" import botMark -%}
{%- set doc = copy.en.countries -%}
<nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">Home</a> /
  {%- if navigation.has.benchmarks %} <a href="{{ '/benchmarks/' | url }}">Benchmarks</a> / {% endif %}
  <span aria-current="page">Countries</span></nav>
<div class="phead"><h1>{{ doc.data.h1 }}</h1>
  <p class="plead">{{ doc.data.lead | mdInline | safe }}</p></div>

<div class="grid4" style="margin-bottom:26px">
{%- for c in profiles.countries %}
  <a class="cc {{ c.key }}" href="{{ c.url | url }}"><div><div class="rank-n">#{{ loop.index }} by assistants with a confirmed problem</div>
    <span class="flag">{{ c.key | flag }}</span>
    <h3>{{ c.name }}</h3><div class="stat">{{ c.confirmed }} of {{ c.bots | length }} assistants confirmed &middot;
      {{ c.critical }} critical &middot; {{ c.language | languageName }}</div></div>
    <div class="bots-mini">{% for b in c.bots %}{{ botMark(logos, b.key, "sm") }}{% endfor %}</div></a>
{%- endfor %}
</div>

<div class="shead"><h2>{{ 'section.sameClaim' | t }}</h2><span style="font-size:13px;color:var(--dimmer)">persona {{ profiles.matrix.persona }} &middot; news-style questions &middot; markets are never merged</span></div>
<div class="panel"><table>
  <caption class="visually-hidden">Repeat rate per assistant in each market on news-style questions, each cell with its interval and sample size</caption>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col">{{ 'col.chatbot' | t }}</th>
    {%- for c in profiles.countries %}<th scope="col" class="num">{{ c.key | flag }} {{ c.key | upper }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {%- for row in profiles.matrix.rows %}
    <tr data-persona="{{ profiles.matrix.persona }}">
      <th scope="row" style="font-weight:400"><span class="markcell">{{ botMark(logos, row.chatbot, "sm", true) }}{{ row.name }}</span></th>
      {%- for cell in row.cells %}<td class="num"><span class="cellstat{% if cell.repeat_rate.low_n %} lown{% endif %}">{{ cell.repeat_rate.rate | rate }}<small>{{ cell.repeat_rate.ci | ciLabel }} &middot; n={{ cell.repeat_rate.n }}</small></span></td>{% endfor %}
    </tr>
  {%- endfor %}
  </tbody></table></div>
<p class="note" style="margin-bottom:34px">Rows are assistants, columns are markets, and nothing is
  averaged across either. Two markets differ only when their intervals do not overlap; where they overlap
  the difference is directional and this page does not claim it. There is no score per country: countries
  are not ranked, assistants are.</p>
